---
import Base from '~/layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy">
  <div class="wrap narrow section-tight prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Plain-language summary</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="lead">This site is built to keep association business among owners.</p>
    <h2>What visitors can see</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Anyone: community information, the meeting calendar, governing documents, and a map of lot lines and street addresses.</li>
      <li>Signed-in owners only: financial reports, minutes, newsletters, board rosters, surveys, voting, and owner names and basic property facts on the map.</li>
      <li>The neighbor directory lists only owners who opt in, and only the details they choose to share.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What we store</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Your name, email, and the lot linked to your account; anything you submit through forms, surveys and ballots.</li>
      <li>Ballots are secret: the system records that a lot has voted, never how it voted.</li>
      <li>A sign-in cookie that scripts on the page cannot read. No advertising or analytics trackers, and no third-party cookies.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Where the map data comes from</h2>
    <p>Lot boundaries, addresses and property facts come from Bedford County's public GIS records. Owner mailing addresses, sale prices and assessed values are deliberately not shown.</p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>To see, correct or delete your information, <a href="/contact">contact the board</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
